{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301020/extras/TituloEON_Gif.gif?t=1730727267\" /><strong>Echoes of Nara</strong> tells the story of a Dreamknight, Nara, as he journeys through a mysterious and captivating dream world. His goal is to free the inhabitants of this realm from their worst nightmares, facing the deep fears and nightmares that dwell within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301020/extras/Nara_Mito_Portal.gif?t=1730727267\" />Explore diverse worlds, each with unique mechanics and visual styles. Discover the challenges that await Nara in the dreams and nightmares of the inhabitants of <strong>Sognaris</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301020/extras/Torre_Move+Dash.gif?t=1730727267\" />Each world will be completely different, allowing you to switch between dimensions or use special abilities tailored to each environment to overcome or escape nightmares as you uncover the secrets the world of Sognaris holds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301020/extras/Nara_Achievements.gif?t=1730727267\" />Discover the Star Park, a resting area and nexus between the many dreams and nightmares of Sognaris where you can also gather information by obtaining collectibles, achivements and level goals that will rebuild the world as you know it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3301020?t=1730727267","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1730727267","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301020/292f6e5e0fa0bf9208c8d9e062d6342